*.log

# ---------- Compass Planner: generated artifacts ----------
# rebuild.py extracts the app source out of Compass_Planner.html into here,
# edits happen, then it re-embeds. The .html is the source of truth; this
# directory is scratch and is regenerated on every extract.
build/template.html
build/*.tmp

# Response captures used to diff endpoints across stages 3-4
snapshots/
*.response.json

